type RegulatoryClassification: <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t2024-12-12). The base type which all regulatory classification types \t\t\t\textend.">

type RegulatoryClassificationASIC_2013 extends RegulatoryClassification: <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">

    supervisoryBody string (0..*) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    reportingRole ReportingRole (0..1) <"Identifies the role of this party in reporting this trade for \t\t\t\t\t\tthis regulator; roles could include ReportingParty and Voluntary \t\t\t\t\t\treporting.">
    reportingPurpose ReportingPurpose (0..*) <"The reason this message is being sent, for example Snapshot, \t\t\t\t\t\tPET, Confirmation, RealTimePublic.">
    interAffiliate boolean (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    actionType ActionType (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). A notation to indicate whether the report being made \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trelates to : (a) a Reportable Transaction that is an entry into of \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tan arrangement that is a Derivative, in which case the notation must \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbe \"new\"; (b) a Reportable Transaction that is a modification of an \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tarrangement that is a Derivative, in which case the notation must be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"modify\"; (c) a Reportable Transaction that is a termination of an \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tarrangement that is a Derivative, in which case the notation must be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"cancel\"; or (d) a compression of a Derivative, in which case the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tnotation must be \"compression\". For the purposes of subrule \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2.2.2(1), a notation to indicate whether the change relates to: (a) \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta cancellation of a report previously made in error, in which case, \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe notation must be \"error\"; (b) a change or update to the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinformation referred to in items 30-32 (mark-to-market, \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmark-to-model, or other valuation) or items 40-44 (collateral), in \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twhich case the notation must be \"valuation update\"; or (c) any other \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tamendments to a report previously made, in which case the notation \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmust be \"other\".">
    isAccountingHedge boolean (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). If the Reporting Entity is not an Australian ADI, an \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAFS Licensee, a CS Facility Licensee, an Exempt Foreign Licensee or \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta Foreign ADI, an indication of whether the Derivative to which the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReportable Transaction relates is entered into by the Reporting \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEntity for the purpose of managing a financial risk that arises in \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe ordinary course of business.">

type RegulatoryClassificationCSA_2016 extends RegulatoryClassification: <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">

    supervisoryBody string (0..*) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    reportingRole ReportingRole (0..1) <"Identifies the role of this party in reporting this trade for \t\t\t\t\t\tthis regulator; roles could include ReportingParty and Voluntary \t\t\t\t\t\treporting.">
    reportingPurpose ReportingPurpose (0..*) <"The reason this message is being sent, for example Snapshot, \t\t\t\t\t\tPET, Confirmation, RealTimePublic.">
    interAffiliate boolean (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    actionType ActionType (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). Describes the type of event to the transaction (e.g., \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tnew transaction, modification or cancellation of existing \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttransaction, etc.). TBD: FpML doesn’t currently define a coding \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tscheme for this value. We anticipate that one will be developed in a \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfuture release.">
    eventType string (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). Indicate whether the transaction resulted from a \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpost-transaction service (e.g. compression, reconciliation, etc.) or \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfrom a lifecycle event (e.g. novation, amendment, etc.). TBD: FpML \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdoesn’t currently define a coding scheme for this value. We \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tanticipate that one will be developed in a future \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trelease.">

type RegulatoryClassificationEMIR_2015 extends RegulatoryClassification: <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">

    supervisoryBody EMIRSupervisoryBodyEnum (0..*) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). The regulator or other supervisory body the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\torganization is registered with (e.g. ESMA).">
    reportingRole ReportingRole (0..1) <"Identifies the role of this party in reporting this trade for \t\t\t\t\t\tthis regulator; roles could include ReportingParty and Voluntary \t\t\t\t\t\treporting.">
    reportingPurpose ReportingPurpose (0..*) <"The reason this message is being sent, for example Snapshot, \t\t\t\t\t\tPET, Confirmation, RealTimePublic.">
    buyerPartyReference PartyReference (0..1) <"Indicates the party this regulator considers to be the buyer">
    sellerPartyReference PartyReference (0..1) <"Indicates the party this regulator considers to be the seller.">
    tradePartyRelationshipType PartyRelationshipType (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). Indicates how the parties to the trade (the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcounterparties) are related to each other with respect to this \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treporting regime, e.g. Affiliated, Intragroup, \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tetc..">
    actionType ActionType (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). Reports a regulator-specific code for the action \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tassociated with this submission. Used, for example, to report \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe ESMA action type.">
    mandatorilyClearable CanonicalBoolean (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    exceedsClearingThreshold boolean (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). Indicates whether the counterparty exceeds the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvolume threshold above which trades are required to be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcleared.">
    reportingPartyClassification EntityClassification (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). Indicates the category or classification or \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbusiness role of the organization referenced by the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpartyTradeInformation with respect to this reporting regime, for \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\texample Financial, NonFinancial etc.">
    counterPartyClassification EntityClassification (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). Indicates the category or classification or \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbusiness role of the organization referenced by the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpartyTradeInformation with respect to this reporting regime, for \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\texample Financial, NonFinancial etc.">
    counterPartyisEEA boolean (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12). Indicates whether the counterparty is in the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEuropean Economic Area">
    contractType ESMAContractType (0..1) <"ESMA prodcut classification">
    deliveryType ESMADeliveryType (0..1) <"ESMA delivery type">
    creditDetails ESMACreditDetails (0..1) <"Provides the ESMA-specific credit product details used for Level 3 regulatory classification of the reported contract.">
    underlyer ESMAProductUnderlyer (0..1) <"Specifies the ESMA product underlyer details associated with the reported contract for regulatory recordkeeping and trade reporting.">

type RegulatoryClassificationMAS_2013 extends RegulatoryClassification: <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">

    supervisoryBody string (0..*) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
