type RegulatoryClassificationPart45_2012 extends RegulatoryClassification: <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">

    supervisoryBody string (0..*) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    reportingRole ReportingRole (0..1) <"Identifies the role of this party in reporting this trade for \t\t\t\t\t\tthis regulator; roles could include ReportingParty and Voluntary \t\t\t\t\t\treporting.">
    reportingPurpose ReportingPurpose (0..*) <"The reason this message is being sent, for example Snapshot, \t\t\t\t\t\tPET, Confirmation, RealTimePublic.">
    buyerPartyReference PartyReference (0..1) <"Indicates the party this regulator considers to be the buyer">
    sellerPartyReference PartyReference (0..1) <"Indicates the party this regulator considers to be the seller.">
    mandatorilyClearable ReportingBoolean (0..1) <"Whether the particular trade type in question is \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trequired by this regulator to be cleared. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    endUserException boolean (0..1) <"Specifies whether the trade is not \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tobligated to be cleared via a derivative clearing \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\torganization, i.e. wehter there is an exemption from \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclearing. For historical reasons this is called \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"end-user exception\", but this may be used to indication \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tany exception from normal clearing mandates caused by \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe type of the partiees or their relationship, such as \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinter-affiliate trades. If a relatedParty block with a \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trole of ClearingExceptionParty is present, that related \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tparty indicates which party is claiming the end user \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\texception. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    endUserExceptionReason ClearingExceptionReason (0..*) <"Specifies a reason that the trade is \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\texempted from a clearing requirement. This exemption may \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbe an end-user exception, or another type such as in \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinter-affiliate trade. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    endUserExceptionDeclaration EndUserExceptionDeclaration (0..1) <"Claims an end user exception and provides \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsupporting evidence. If a relatedParty block with a role of \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tClearingExceptionParty is present, that related party \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tindicates which party is claiming the end user \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\texception. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    largeSizeTrade boolean (0..1) <"Specifies whether the sender of this trade \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconsiders it to be a large notional trade or block trade for \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treporting purposes, and thus eligible for delayed public \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treporting. Normally this will only be applicable for \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\toff-facility trades. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    executionType ExecutionType (0..1) <"Used to describe how the trade was executed, e.g. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvia voice or electronically. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    executionVenueType ExecutionVenueType (0..1) <"Used to describe the type of venue where trade \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twas executed, e.g via an execution facility or \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tprivately. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    verificationMethod VerificationMethod (0..1) <"Used to describe how the trade was or will be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tverified, e.g via a confirmation facility, via private \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\telectronic service, or via written documentation. This affect \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe timing of real-time reporting requirements. This field is \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tprovisional pending detailed confirmation of the data \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trequirements, and may not be included in subsequent working \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdrafts. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    confirmationMethod ConfirmationMethod (0..1) <"Used to describe how the trade was confirmed, e.g \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvia a confirmation facility, via private electronic service, or \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvia written documentation. This affects the process flow for \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconfirmation messages. This field is provisional pending \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdetailed confirmation of the data requirements, and may not be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tincluded in subsequent working drafts. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    collateralizationType CollateralizationType (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    reportingPartyOrganizationType string (0..1) <"E.g. SD, MSP, etc. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    counterPartyOrganizationType string (0..1) <"E.g. SD, MSP, etc. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    counterPartyIsUsPerson boolean (0..1) <"whether the counterparty is a US \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tperson DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    intentToAllocate boolean (0..1) <"Specifies whether the trade is anticipated to be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tallocated. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    allocationStatus AllocationReportingStatus (0..1) <"Specifies whether the trade is anticipated to be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tallocated, has been allocated, or will not be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tallocated. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    allocationAgent PartyReference (0..1) <"Identifies the party responsible for executing \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe allocation for the counterparty DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    multiAssetSwap boolean (0..1) <"Indicates whether the swap is a multi-asset swap \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tas defined by CFTC Part 45. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    mixedSwap boolean (0..1) <"Indicates whether the swap is a mixed swap as \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdefined by CFTC Part 45 (i.e. subject to reporting to both CFTC \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand SEC). DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    contractType ProductId (0..1) <"Indicatdes the CFTC Contract \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttype. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">

    condition Choice:
        endUserExceptionDeclaration is absent
            or endUserException is absent and endUserExceptionReason is absent

type RegulatoryClassificationPart45_2019 extends RegulatoryClassification: <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">

    supervisoryBody string (0..*) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    reportingRole ReportingRole (0..1) <"Identifies the role of this party in reporting this trade for \t\t\t\t\t\tthis regulator; roles could include ReportingParty and Voluntary \t\t\t\t\t\treporting.">
    reportingPurpose ReportingPurpose (0..*) <"The reason this message is being sent, for example Snapshot, \t\t\t\t\t\tPET, Confirmation, RealTimePublic.">
    buyerPartyReference PartyReference (0..1) <"Indicates the party this regulator considers to be the buyer">
    sellerPartyReference PartyReference (0..1) <"Indicates the party this regulator considers to be the seller.">
    mandatorilyClearable ReportingBoolean (0..1) <"Whether the particular trade type in question is \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trequired by this regulator to be cleared. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    endUserException boolean (0..1) <"Specifies whether the trade is not \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tobligated to be cleared via a derivative clearing \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\torganization, i.e. wehter there is an exemption from \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclearing. For historical reasons this is called \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"end-user exception\", but this may be used to indication \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tany exception from normal clearing mandates caused by \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe type of the partiees or their relationship, such as \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinter-affiliate trades. If a relatedParty block with a \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trole of ClearingExceptionParty is present, that related \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tparty indicates which party is claiming the end user \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\texception. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    endUserExceptionReason ClearingExceptionReason (0..*) <"Specifies a reason that the trade is \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\texempted from a clearing requirement. This exemption may \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbe an end-user exception, or another type such as in \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinter-affiliate trade. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    endUserExceptionDeclaration EndUserExceptionDeclaration (0..1) <"Claims an end user exception and provides \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsupporting evidence. If a relatedParty block with a role of \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tClearingExceptionParty is present, that related party \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tindicates which party is claiming the end user \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\texception. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    largeSizeTrade boolean (0..1) <"Specifies whether the sender of this trade \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconsiders it to be a large notional trade or block trade for \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treporting purposes, and thus eligible for delayed public \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treporting. Normally this will only be applicable for \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\toff-facility trades. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    executionType ExecutionType (0..1) <"Used to describe how the trade was executed, e.g. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvia voice or electronically. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    executionVenueType ExecutionVenueType (0..1) <"Used to describe the type of venue where trade \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twas executed, e.g via an execution facility or \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tprivately. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    verificationMethod VerificationMethod (0..1) <"Used to describe how the trade was or will be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tverified, e.g via a confirmation facility, via private \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\telectronic service, or via written documentation. This affect \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe timing of real-time reporting requirements. This field is \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tprovisional pending detailed confirmation of the data \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trequirements, and may not be included in subsequent working \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdrafts. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    confirmationMethod ConfirmationMethod (0..1) <"Used to describe how the trade was confirmed, e.g \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvia a confirmation facility, via private electronic service, or \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvia written documentation. This affects the process flow for \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconfirmation messages. This field is provisional pending \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdetailed confirmation of the data requirements, and may not be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tincluded in subsequent working drafts. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    collateralizationType CollateralizationType (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    reportingPartyOrganizationType string (0..1) <"E.g. SD, MSP, etc. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    counterPartyOrganizationType string (0..1) <"E.g. SD, MSP, etc. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    counterPartyIsUsPerson boolean (0..1) <"whether the counterparty is a US \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tperson DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    allocationStatus AllocationReportingStatus (0..1) <"Specifies whether the trade is anticipated to be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tallocated, has been allocated, or will not be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tallocated. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    clientAccountType TradeCategory (0..1) <"Specifies whether the reporting party takes a \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPrincipal or an Agent role in this trade. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    interAffiliateClearingExemptionParty PartyReference (0..1) <"Identifies which party is electing the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinter-affiliate exmption to the clearing requirement pursuant to \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsection 50.52 DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    reportingPartyClearingExemption string (0..*) <"Identifies the type of clearing exemption that \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe Counterparty 1 has elected (if not indicated previously). \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAll applicable exceptions and exemption must be selected. The \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvalues may be repeacted as applicable. TBD: FpML doesn’t \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcurrently define a coding scheme for this value. We anticipate \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthat one will be developed in a future \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trelease. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    counterPartyClearingExemption string (0..*) <"Identifies the type of clearing exemption that \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe Counterparty 2 has elected (if not indicated previously). \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAll applicable exceptions and exemption must be selected. The \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvalues may be repeacted as applicable. TBD: FpML doesn’t \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcurrently define a coding scheme for this value. We anticipate \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthat one will be developed in a future \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trelease. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    collateralTypeAllowed string (0..*) <"Identifies the types of collateral that may be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tposted according to the CSA. TBD: FpML doesn’t currently define \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta coding scheme for this value. We anticipate that one will be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdeveloped in a future release. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    collateralPortfolioContainsNonReportableComponents boolean (0..1) <"Indicator of whether the collateral portfolio \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tincludes transactions exempt from reporting. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    packageContainsNonReportableComponents boolean (0..1) <"Indicator of whether the package in which this \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttrade was traded includes transactions exempt from \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treporting. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    specialEntityType string (0..1) <"The type of Special entity/utility special entity \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthat is reported by the reporting counterparty as per Section \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t23.401(c) and Section 1.3 (ggg)(4)(i)(B)(2), respectively. Note \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthat \"utility special entity\" is a subset of \"special entity.\" \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTBD: FpML doesn’t currently define a coding scheme for this \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvalue. We anticipate that one will be developed in a future \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trelease. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    actionType ActionType (0..1) <"Reports a regulator-specific code for the action \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tassociated with this submission. Used, for example, to report \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe ESMA action type. TBD: FpML doesn’t currently define a \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcoding scheme for this value. We anticipate that one will be \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdeveloped in a future release. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    eventType string (0..1) <"Explanation for the action being take on the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttransaction. TBD: FpML doesn’t currently define a coding scheme \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor this value. We anticipate that one will be developed in a \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfuture release. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    tradeExecutionRequirementIndicator boolean (0..1) <"The data element will indicate if the swap is \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsubject to the trade execution requirement under CEA section \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2(h)(8). If the swap is subject to an exemption from CEA section \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2(h)(8)(a), this data element shall be populated with the value \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"False\". DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    lastFloatingReferenceResetDate zonedDateTime (0..1) <"The date of the most recent sampling of the \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfloating reference for the purposes of determining cashflow. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTies to \"Last Floating Reference Value\" \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfield. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    nextFloatingReferenceResetDate zonedDateTime (0..1) <"The nearest date in the future that the floating \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treference resets on DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">

    condition Choice:
        endUserExceptionDeclaration is absent
            or endUserException is absent and endUserExceptionReason is absent

type RegulatoryClassificationSFTR_2019 extends RegulatoryClassification: <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">

    reportingRole ReportingRole (0..1) <"Identifies the role of this party in reporting this trade for \t\t\t\t\t\tthis regulator; roles could include ReportingParty and Voluntary \t\t\t\t\t\treporting.">
    reportingPurpose ReportingPurpose (0..*) <"The reason this message is being sent, for example Snapshot, \t\t\t\t\t\tPET, Confirmation, RealTimePublic.">
    reportingLevel ReportingLevel (0..1) <"An indication whether the report is done at trade or \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tposition level. DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">
    actionType ActionType (0..1) <"SFTR notation to indicate whether the report is New, \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tModification, Valuation, Collateral update, Error, Correction, \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTermination / Early Termination or Position component DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2024-12-12).">

type RegulatoryTradingObligation: <"A regulatory record indicating whether trading occurred on a venue and, where applicable, whether an exception applies, with the corresponding facility execution exception declaration.">

    tradedOnVenue boolean (1..1) <"Whether the particular product must be executed on a SEF or \t\t\t\t\t\tDCM. See to Dodd-Frank section 723(a)(8).">
    exception boolean (0..1) <"Specifies whether the party invoked exception to not execute \t\t\t\t\t\tthe trade on facility such as SEF and DCM even though the particular product \t\t\t\t\t\tis mandated to execute on a SEF.">
    exceptionDeclaration FacilityExecutionExceptionDeclaration (0..1) <"Provides supporting evidence when a party invoked exception \t\t\t\t\t\tto not execute the trade on facility such as SEF and DCM even though the \t\t\t\t\t\tparticular product is mandated to execute on a SEF.">
